Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:11.32,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}かけがえのない君と
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:13.63,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}これから先も
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.27,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}嘘はつかない Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.92,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}Go! Go! 自分に
